  "description": "DAPDAB crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C119 H185 Co4 Dy6 N1 O50 P6,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Co1 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Co4 (Co) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.340-4.096 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.18-125.96°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [CoII4DyIII6(O3PCH2Ph)6(O2C tBu)14(HO2C tBu)(MeCN)(H2O)2]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
